# 紹介の動画の手順（make video FLOW=e2e/showcase.flow）。周回の種は World.fixedSeed（地図は 1a）。
# 題名 → 薬草を拾う → スワイプのダッシュで通路へ → 起きたゼリーを通路の口で殴る → 部屋で弓兵に列をそろえられて矢が飛ぶ
# → コウモリを殴って爆弾を拾う（薬が効く）→ 2 体に囲まれて爆弾 → 鉄の剣（上位）を拾う → 階段で待って降りる → Clear。
start title
mark in_all
wait 1.5
tap confirm
wait 0.7
expect screen=Play&col=3&row=3
wait 0.5
# 始まりの小部屋で薬草を拾う
tap left
wait 0.7
tap up
wait 0.7
expect col=2&row=2
tap down
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
tap up
wait 0.3
# スワイプのダッシュ: 部屋から通路へ 1 歩、通路は角を曲がって、ゼリーが起きた所で止まる
tap dashRight
tap dashRight
until !busy max 3
expect col=7&row=2
wait 0.4
# ゼリーが寄ってくるのを待ち、通路の口で 3 回殴って倒す
tap wait
wait 0.7
tap wait
wait 0.7
tap wait
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
expect foes=3
wait 0.5
# 下の部屋へ。弓兵が列をそろえて矢を撃ってくる
tap right
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap left
wait 0.7
tap left
wait 0.7
tap left
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap left
wait 0.7
# 道をふさぐコウモリを殴って倒す
tap down
wait 0.7
tap left
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
# 爆弾を拾う（HP が減って薬草が効く）
tap left
wait 0.7
expect bombs=2
wait 0.4
# ゼリーと弓兵の 2 体の隣へ出て、爆弾で両方倒す
tap right
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
expect foes=0&bombs=1
wait 0.8
# 鉄の剣（上位）を拾い、階段で待って降りる
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.7
tap right
wait 0.7
tap down
wait 0.6
tap left
wait 0.3
tap wait
until !busy max 3
expect screen=Clear
wait 2.0
mark out_all
